language 0.1.0
module quality
  means
    Measurable characteristics of a system and the conditions under which
    those characteristics are assessed against required levels.

entity quality-attribute : thing
  means
    quality attribute: an aspect of a system's behaviour or outcome whose
    degree is subject to assessment.

entity metric : thing
  means
    metric: a formally defined way of quantifying a quality attribute.

entity measurement : thing
  means
    measurement: an obtained value of a metric together with the conditions
    and the moment of its obtaining.

entity objective : thing
  means
    objective: a required level of a metric under definite conditions.

entity threshold : thing
  means
    threshold: a boundary of the admissible value of a metric.

entity workload : thing
  means
    workload: a formal description of the intensity and composition of the
    influences on a system during quality assessment.
